1
00:00:11,976 --> 00:00:15,068
Quel jour sommes-nous aujourd'hui ?
What day is it today?

2
00:00:15,168 --> 00:00:17,948
Nous sommes jeudi.
It's Thursday.

3
00:00:18,048 --> 00:00:20,420
Et demain ?
And tomorrow?

4
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:26,876
Demain, c'est vendredi. Hier, c'était mercredi.
Tomorrow is Friday. Yesterday was Wednesday.

5
00:00:26,976 --> 00:00:29,828
Tu travailles le samedi ?
Do you work on Saturdays?

6
00:00:29,928 --> 00:00:34,148
Non, le samedi, je ne travaille pas.
No, on Saturdays I don't work.

7
00:00:34,248 --> 00:00:36,860
Et le dimanche ?
And on Sundays?

8
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:40,316
Le dimanche, je dors !
On Sundays I sleep!
